guide completionist-horde/unplaced-quests
title Quests the data cannot place
faction Horde
category Miscellaneous
folder Completionist events and extras
levels 1-60
zone Orgrimmar
pitch A checklist: the quests Polestar's reference data names but cannot lead to.

step About this guide
  note The reference data has no giver, hand-in, level or zone for these quests, so no guide can lead to them. Each is listed by its title for you to find and tick off. Some may not be in the game.

step Alterac Valley
  task "Launch the Attack!, level 60" optional -- quest 6901

step Darkspear Islands
  task "Darkspear's Standard Care Package, level 49" optional -- quest 98911
  task "Darkspear's Advanced Care Package, level 60" optional -- quest 98912

step Durotar
  task "Swift as the Wind, level 60" optional only Troll -- quest 99201
  task "An Epic Ride, level 60" optional only Troll -- quest 99218

step Eastern Plaguelands
  task "Argent Arbiter, level 57" optional -- quest 97986
  task "Orgrimmar's Windshapers, level 57" optional -- quest 97988
  task "Bleeding Edge, level 57" optional -- quest 98109

step Ironforge
  task "Your Reward has Arrived!" optional -- quest 60860

step Riverglades
  task "Magic Over Might, level 40" optional -- quest 96028
  task "Might Over Magic, level 41" optional -- quest 96027

step Tirisfal Glades
  task "Justice and Retribution, level 60" optional only Paladin -- quest 97185

step Western Plaguelands
  task "Rapid Escape" optional -- quest 8152

step No zone in the data
  task "A Ticking Present, level 40" optional -- quest 79637
  task "Krol'dok No More!, level 42" optional -- quest 95056
